{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43261","headline":"冬至日祥风应候 · 穆寂","name":"冬至日祥风应候","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"节逢清景至，占气二仪中。\n独喜登台日，先知应候风。\n呈祥光舜化，表庆感尧聪。\n既与乘时叶，还将入律同。\n微微万井遍，习习九门通。\n更绕鑪烟起，殷勤报岁功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"穆寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}